LangChain is a framework/ecosystem for building applications around LLMs.

It provides components for:

Models
Prompts
Tools
Retrieval
Agents
Structured outputs
Document processing
Simple architecture
User
 ↓
Prompt
 ↓
LLM
 ↓
Tool
 ↓
Response

LangChain helps developers connect these components.

Example
from langchain_google_genai import ChatGoogleGenerativeAI

llm = ChatGoogleGenerativeAI(
    model="gemini-2.5-flash"
)

response = llm.invoke("What is RAG?")
